      "heading": "Quiz on the Annual Report",
      "text": "The Annual Report showcases this based on the various projects and activities we tackled in 2017. One of these projects, for instance, was the ETH Zurich’s Research Collection , developed and provided by ETH Library.\n\nLearn about this and much more in the ETH Library 2017 Annual Report (German only)."
